# THREE: = Strcat {{*}}[isLikelyKey, isLikelyName]
# RUN(NOPARTS): walk f2:Body mechanisms=all
# NOPARTS-NOT: ElemGetByKeyParts
# Where the helper is called and not copied there are no parts to go by.
# RUN(CALLED): walk f1:Body mechanisms=all-Inlining
# CALLED-NOT: ElemGetByKeyParts

